		{"id":"4f3841c8deb22e1b","type":"file","file":"2. Cyber Security 101/4. Linux Fundamental/screenshots/ps.png","x":1180,"y":1041,"width":400,"height":255},
		{"id":"8f0dab07f5729cb7","type":"text","text":" the second process ps has a PID of 204, and then in the command below it, this is then incremented to 205.","x":1180,"y":800,"width":400,"height":89},
		{"id":"720f71669883157a","type":"text","text":"### Filtering so imp\nfind / -type f -name .flag.txt 2>/dev/null","x":-232,"y":300,"width":357,"height":79},
		{"id":"61ef46d2361cdb22","type":"text","text":"# Linux","x":-509,"y":-129,"width":169,"height":60},
		{"id":"5750bc46d1d42e09","type":"text","text":"# Download any file\nwget  \"url\"\n\n---","x":-232,"y":-69,"width":250,"height":229},
		{"id":"8304b48c5dd10f5a","type":"text","text":"# Editor\nnano \nvim","x":-232,"y":-213,"width":250,"height":113},
		{"id":"8cc46edcc3595bbd","type":"text","text":"Process 1 tarah ka program hai jo mahine ke andar run ho raha hota hai","x":420,"y":1127,"width":380,"height":82},
		{"id":"81db045fdc9693da","type":"text","text":"jo kernel dwara manage kiya jata hai , har process ki apani id hoti hai , jise PID bolate hai ","x":420,"y":1280,"width":380,"height":60},
		{"id":"4aa416b1c52c3e61","type":"text","text":"# Process","x":84,"y":1138,"width":216,"height":60},
		{"id":"c9675f08b349d751","type":"text","text":"**Transferring Files From Your Host - SCP (SSH)**\n\n| Variable                                                    | Value             |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| The IP address of the remote system                         | `192.168.1.30`    |\n| User on the remote system                                   | `ubuntu`          |\n| Name of the file on the local system                        | `important.txt`   |\n| Name that we wish to store the file as on the remote system | `transferred.txt` |\n","x":240,"y":-69,"width":619,"height":233},
		{"id":"3418d069e8e3b14a","type":"file","file":"2. Cyber Security 101/4. Linux Fundamental/screenshots/ps_aux.png","x":1058,"y":1500,"width":644,"height":259},
		{"id":"a8ddaa9cb59b5762","type":"file","file":"2. Cyber Security 101/4. Linux Fundamental/screenshots/kill_process.png","x":2140,"y":1500,"width":623,"height":259},
		{"id":"42f21fa655b1fbc8","type":"text","text":"```\nscp important.txt ubuntu@192.168.1.30:/home/ubuntu/transferred.txt\n```","x":240,"y":300,"width":619,"height":80},
		{"id":"3cac10902e7a41a6","type":"file","file":"2. Cyber Security 101/4. Linux Fundamental/screenshots/shareFileUsingScp.png","x":920,"y":267,"width":400,"height":146},
		{"id":"368b096f0dc75659","type":"text","text":"# Second Way","x":425,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"2d4c835feff00c7f","type":"text","text":"Run this cmd\njaha par file downlaod karani h","x":1080,"y":-280,"width":283,"height":60},
		{"id":"fcf2b4bca02dce53","type":"text","text":"```\nwget http://10.48.134.144:8000/myfil\n```","x":1440,"y":-290,"width":370,"height":80},
		{"id":"3ed13618ee90a9ca","type":"text","text":"```\npython3 -m http.server 80\n```","x":1440,"y":-660,"width":293,"height":87},
		{"id":"f1d26030af6f44d6","type":"text","text":"Run This cmd\njaha se file bhejani h","x":1080,"y":-646,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5bcf53fadb2cec0f","type":"file","file":"2. Cyber Security 101/4. Linux Fundamental/screenshots/usefulcmd.png","x":1181,"y":1880,"width":400,"height":276},
		{"id":"25f832737b60aa72","type":"file","file":"2. Cyber Security 101/4. Linux Fundamental/screenshots/service start on boot.png","x":2140,"y":1880,"width":623,"height":361},
		{"id":"933641c18e41f085","type":"text","text":"# Crontab","x":734,"y":3740,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"dc50feeb0170b9e6","type":"text","text":"Crontab tab run hota hai jab hamara system boot hota hai , or isake andar time ke hisab se processign hoti hai , agar koi file ya ko code execute karanahai kisi specific time par tab use hota hai crontab","x":1160,"y":3716,"width":532,"height":109},
		{"id":"fe3421a1d8db734c","type":"text","text":"| Value  | Description                              |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `MIN`  | What minute to execute at                |\n| `HOUR` | What hour to execute at                  |\n| `DOM`  | What day of the month to execute at      |\n| `MON`  | What month of the year to execute at     |\n| `DOW`  | What day of the week to execute at       |\n| `CMD`  | The actual command that will be executed |\n","x":1221,"y":3960,"width":411,"height":228},
		{"id":"17eff813df14496f","type":"file","file":"2. Cyber Security 101/4. Linux Fundamental/screenshots/crontab.jpeg","x":1760,"y":3836,"width":886,"height":476},
